WEBVTT

NOTE The recording has no sound; these captions say what happens on screen.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.236
Airc, on a made-up coffee shop. ⌘T opens the Command Bar; Ask hands what you type to the Airc Agent.

00:05.236 --> 00:08.999
The task: “Compare the Pour and Rapid kettles and buy the better one for pour over coffee. Ask me before you pay.”

00:08.999 --> 00:17.819
The task's page opens as a tab in Today, with a glow and the bar “Airc Agent is using this tab”. The agent searches the shop and puts both kettles side by side, while the pane beside it lists each step.

00:17.819 --> 00:24.075
Take over gives you the tab at once; Stop ends the task. Until then your clicks and typing don't reach the page.

00:24.075 --> 00:28.702
The agent says why the Pour suits pour-over, adds it to the bag and goes to payment.

00:28.702 --> 00:35.956
At Pay, Airc stops it and asks in the pane. Allow once is clicked.

00:35.956 --> 00:41.456
The order is placed, the tab is yours again, and the agent says which kettle it bought and why.
